### Emitir NFS-e simples
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/nfse/emissoes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: exemplo-local-001

{
  "idempotencyKey": "pedido-123-v1",
  "competencia": "2026-05-08",
  "prestador": {
    "cnpj": "12345678000195",
    "inscricaoMunicipal": "123456789"
  },
  "tomador": {
    "cpf": "11905650647",
    "nome": "Cliente Exemplo",
    "email": "cliente@example.com"
  },
  "servico": {
    "codigoServicoNacional": "010101",
    "descricao": "Servico de desenvolvimento de software",
    "valor": 1000.00,
    "codigoTributacaoMunicipal": "101"
  }
}

### Consultar status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/nfse/emissoes/{{emissionId}}/status
X-Correlation-Id: exemplo-local-001
